        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprise GCP, Twisted Rope Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Twist Cabinet Pull is a modern take on a classic. The style is reminiscent of rope, but the essence is contemporary. This Twisted Rope Cabinet Pull is available in 3 sizes: 3-1/2 inch, 4 inch, and 6 inch. It is available in polished brass, polished nickel, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Each cabinet door handle comes packaged with a set of rosettes that add a final touch or refinement.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<a href=\"/products/2-1-4-inch-twist-ring-pull-field-enterprise-rpg-225\"><b>Matching Twist Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Cabinet Door Twist Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes all mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting rosettes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>GPC-350:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>GPC-400:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>GPC-600:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-9/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
